OL,3,AGovernment backs welfare shake-up to
OL,4,Aprevent 'lost generation'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham said he
OL,7,Fendorsed the "principles" of the
OL,8,FMilburn review and was confident he
OL,9,Fcould persuade Labour MPs to back
OL,10,Flegislation to implement its measures.
